    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Women in Health and their Economic, Equity and Livelihood statuses during Emergency Preparedness and Response (WHEELER) study is set to formulate gender inclusive and transformative strategies that will safeguard the female healthcare providers (HCPs) in the current pandemic and during emergency preparedness, response, and recovery phases in future health crises.",
